g: Includes Exhaust Gas Sensor, Catalyst, EGR, VVT, EVAP, Exhaust Gas Sensor, Heater, Heated Catalyst, Secondary Air, Fuel System, Boost Pressure Control, NOx Adsorber, NOx/SCR Catalyst, Misfire Cylinder Data, PM Filter\r\n\r\nSpecial functions: Perform Injector coding, DPF regeneration, Throttle Reset, ABS (Brake) bleeding, Steering angle reset, Power balance, Fuel Density Reset, Learning Value Reset, Actuation Tests, AC Control Module Reset, Indicator light reset, Brake Pedal Position Sensor learning, Light and Door customizations etc. Check the app for the full list applicable to your car.\r\n\r\nPDF report and Support: Get a shareable PDF with code descriptions on scanning a vehicle and share it with your technician, friends, customers or store it for future comparisons. GaragePro also offers email and chat support to its customers.\r\n\r\nTrack mode/Acceleration test- 0-60,0-80, 0-100 and more. Turn on the track mode for accurate acceleration data.\r\n\r\nCompatibility: The GaragePro OBD2 Scanner app works with any vehicle that\u2019s compliant with the OBD2 standard (introduced in the USA in 1996). It is compatible with all American, Japanese, Korean, German & other European car & bike makes. \r\nFor motorcycles, you will need a connecting cable that connects the 16 pin OBD scanner with the bike OBD port. Bike diagnostics include DTC reading & deletion, live data stream & freeze frame data.\r\n\r\nWireless Connectivity: Say goodbye to tangled cables and embrace the wireless convenience of GaragePro. Our app seamlessly connects to your OBD2 Scanner using Bluetooth, eliminating the need for cumbersome cords.\r\n\r\nCompatible OBD2 Scanners: GaragePro works with most bluetooth based OBD scanners, including generic ELM327 scanners. Our recommended scanners are GaragePro (our own scanner- https://garagepro.shop/), VGate, OBDLink, Veepeak, Carista. You can always check with us to get more details.\r\n\r\nPricing: Scanning and live data are free, with higher function